<title>BELGIUM: OLOs end higher, supported by Bunds.</title>
<headline>OLOs end higher, supported by Bunds.</headline>
<text>
<p>1600 GMT - OLOs end higher as Bunds late rally continues, supporting core Europe. OLO/Bund spread bit wider as 14.4 bln Bfr Treasury exchange auction weighs. Franc bit weaker.</p>
<p>*2006 OLO 6.09% (6.11) BE283=, 12 bps over Bunds (10)  MEUR *OLO fut +0.15 at 119.36 BGBc1 ;Mark/Bfr 20.5950/60 (20.5920/30) *3-mo bill 3.02/04% (3.03/05) IRGHWI01 ;1-wk repo 3.00/02 (unch)</p>
<p>-- Brussels Newsroom +32 2 287 6810, Fax +32 2 230 7710</p>
